Hold "Alt" / "Option" to enable pan &amp; zoom  <pre><code>classDiagram
  class ProjectConfig {
    +artifacts_dir: Path
    +worktrees_dir: Path
    +schema_version: str
    +agents: list[str]
    +template_overrides: dict[str, Path]
    +target_branch: str
    +vcs: str
  }

  class SchemaLoader {
    -_schemas_dir: Path
    -_cache: dict
    +load(artifact_type, schema_version) BaseModel
  }

  class CheckResult {
    +name: str
    +description: str
    +passed: bool
    +reason: str
    +artifact_path: str
    +field: str
    +expected: str
    +actual: str
    +rule: str
  }

  class InvocationResult {
    +status: str
    +skill: str
    +feature: str
    +message: str
    +artifacts: list[str]
    +checks: list[CheckResult]
    +errors: list[str]
    +duration_ms: int
    +session_id: str
  }

  class SkillContract {
    &lt;&lt;Protocol&gt;&gt;
    +expected_artifacts(feature_dir) list[Path]
    +run_checks(feature_dir, config, wp_id) list[CheckResult]
  }

  class SkillOutputContract {
    &lt;&lt;Protocol&gt;&gt;
    +emit(result: InvocationResult) None
  }

  class CliOutput {
    +success(...) InvocationResult
    +error(...) InvocationResult
    +emit(result) None
  }

  class SessionLogger {
    -_session_id: str
    +append_debug(entry) None
    +append_audit(entry) None
    +now_iso() str
  }

  InvocationResult "1" --&gt; "*" CheckResult : contains
  CliOutput ..|&gt; SkillOutputContract : satisfies
  CliOutput --&gt; InvocationResult : emits</code></pre>
